{
  "sceneId": "pirate_cabin",
  "image": "rawimages/pirate_ship_cabin/dense_backdrop.jpeg",
  "summary": "A busy pirate cabin: a ship's wheel is mounted on the back wall above a three-tier wall shelf carrying two boxes, folded rainbow towels, and a crate flanked by two barrels, with a hammer-wrench-pliers rack hung below it. A floor-to-ceiling shelf unit crowds the near left corner, stacked with boxes on top and, inside, more boxes, folded linens and stacked planks. A coiled rope hangs from a wall hook and a striped hammock sags from the ceiling into a cargo net filling the top-right corner. A low wooden table holds an open, gold-hinged treasure chest with its lid raised against the wall; an open wardrobe beside it stores boxes and folded towels on three shelves, with a squat barrel at its foot. A round brass porthole flanked by tied-back blue curtains looks out on a sunny sea. A second, closed and locked chest sits beside a striped bunk bed at the right edge, and a round table with a stool stand on open floor before a large oval red-blue-yellow rug. The near foreground is crammed with three barrels at the left, a thick coiled rope pile and a wooden crate at the centre, and another barrel cropped by the right edge; a string of party bunting swags along the top left of the wall.",
  "theme": "pirate",
  "camera": "eye level, gentle wide-angle bow in the wall planks, the same room as the sparse cabin but turned busy; the top eighth now carries bunting on the left and a hammock feeding into a cargo net on the right instead of bare wall, and the floor across the bottom quarter is crowded with barrels, rope and a crate",
